# 12 October 2026 : approach A, REAL polygons for a pixel scale residual pass, then a numpy rasteriser that follows
# rasterizegeo (pixel centres, even-odd fill, the smallest polygon on top as the z order of Fit gives it), to score them.
# Tracing uses Fit.contours_binary and Fit.simplify unchanged; labelling, values and culling are the improved copy:
# value based bins, per region measured mean, regions fully in the wrap padding dropped, duplicate closing point dropped.
# FR : vrais polygones d'une passe pixel, puis rastérisation numpy fidèle à rasterizegeo pour les noter.
